var storyContent = {"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["^You're sitting on the porch, watching the orange sky melt into the horizon. The air is thick with salt. You feel the waves gently pressing against the tall, stilted legs that hold your home above the water.","\n","^You and the Diver share a simple breakfast - freshly baked bread, warm seaweed broth and black coffee. Feeling the hot sun on your face, you already know that the day will be scorching. You feel slightly jealous of the Diver, who soon will slip into the cold, quiet waters.","\n","^She places a shiny pearl on the table.","\n","^\"This shack is barely standing. The generator needs fixing. The roof is leaking.\"","\n","ev","str","^Look at the Sea.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Look at her.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ You lived here, at the Sea, your whole life. The sight of it makes you feel calm, even though you've witnessed its raw power more than once. You feel like it belongs to you, it's yours and you don't like sharing it with outsiders.","\n",{"->":"look"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ You look at her. She's watching the sea. You remember the day she came to your island. She was still a teen, just starting to work as a diver. She came from the North, carrying all of her belongings in just one backpack. The Sea here is different than the one she remembers from her childhood. Calmer, wider, more blue than grey. ","\n","^You know she just needs to feel safe.","\n",{"->":"look"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}]}],"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"look":[["^She sights. \"We need the money now. We just sell one. They will pay good money for it. It's rare and beautiful and they will find it...\"","\n","ev","str","^Finish her sentence","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Let her finish","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ \"... exotic\", you say. ","\n",{"->":"disagree"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ \"... magical\", she finishes. ","\n",{"->":"disagree"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"disagree":[["^You talked about it countless times before. You know that the shack is fragile. You know it might be dangerous. You know she's just worried.","\n","^Still, selling even one of the pearls to the tourists doesn't feel right.","\n","ev","str","^The pearls belong to us","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^The pearls are gifts","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^\"You risked to get those pearls out. They're ours. Selling them just feels... wrong.\"","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"sceptic"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"sceptic","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"argument"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^\"The pearls, they are gifts. You didn't just stumble upon them. The Sea gave them to you. And you do not trade gifts.\"","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"believer","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"argument"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"argument":[["^\"I don't want to give them away either. It's just... We don't have much choice, do we?\"","\n","ev","str","^I don't want to upset the Sea","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^I don't trust the tourists.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ We've talked about this. They're not ours to sell. The Sea gives, but it always remembers. It loves you, but you know how fragile this love is.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"believer","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"argument_2"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ We've talked about this. These tourists are not to be trusted. They are loud, obnoxious, ignorant. I've got a bad feeling about them. Besides, we really can handle this. We don't need them.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"sceptic"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"sceptic","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"argument_2"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"argument_2":[["^\"Are you like... afraid of The Sea? It's not going to hurt us, you know? Even if we sell the pearls. It's just water.\"","\n","ev","str","^Disgree. The Sea is much more than just water","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Agree. You don't believe in supernatural","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You look at the Sea. It's quiet, but you have seen it's true might. You know better. It's not just water.","\n","^\"You say that now, but we both know what the Sea can do.\"","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"believer","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"oppose"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^You look at the Sea. Of course it's not going to seek revenge. It is beautiful, powerful and vast, but it is, in fact, just water.","\n","^\"I know. It's not about the Sea. It's about not leaning on the outsiders to fix our problems.\"","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"sceptic"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"sceptic","re":true},"/ev",{"->":"oppose"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"oppose":[["^\"Just... think about it.\" She shakes her head.","\n","^You nod. You both know you will not change your mind.","\n","^She stands up and grabs her backpack. She kisses you goodbye.","\n","ev","str","^Be safe","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Have fun","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ \"Be safe! I'll see you at dinner.\"","\n","^You know that it's dangerous, what she does.","\n",{"->":"sail_away"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ \"Have fun! I'll see you at dinner.\"","\n","^You know that she loves what she does.","\n",{"->":"sail_away"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"sail_away":[["^You watch her climb down the rope ladder into an old boat. The motor splutters, before it barely starts. She waves at you one last time and steers the boat away. Her silhouette stands out against the sky, getting smaller and smaller.","\n","ev","str","^Clean the table","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"fishnets"},"\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"fishnets":[["^Wooden floors creak beneath your feet as you clean the table and pack your things. You go check the fishnets hanging from the spider-like arms, submerged in the waters below the house. There is some fish in the nets, scales shining in the sun, but it's not much. You pull the nets out of the water, fish trembling, fighting to breathe.","\n","ev","str","^Kill the fish","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"kill_fish"},"\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"kill_fish":[["^You kill them quickly and put them into a small tourist fridge.","\n","^You know the Diver is right. You are in a desparate need of money and the fish you both catch every day is not enough to cover all expenses.","\n","^Maybe just this once... maybe just to survive?","\n","^The pearl is shining on the table where the Diver left it.","\n","ev","str","^Take the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Leave the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Deep down you know: selling the pearls is not the right choice. Still, you grab it and put it in your pocket. Just in case.","\n","^You grab your things and head out to the village.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hasPearl","re":true},{"->":"market"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ Deep down you know: selling the pearls is not the right choice. It should stay right here, close to the Sea, close to you.","\n","^You leave it on the table, grab your things and head out to the village.","\n",{"->":"market"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"market":[["^The Sun is already high when you reach the market. You feel the sweat trickling down your spine, the fridge starts to feel a little bit heavy.","\n","^\"Fisher, here!\".","\n","^Eloise is sitting on an overturned bucket next to her stand, weaving a small wicker basket. She is waving at you.","\n","^It's hot and you're worried the fridge won't keep the fish fresh for too long.","\n","ev","str","^It'll be fine. Just a few minutes. Go talk to Eloise","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You'll catch her later. Now you should hurry","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"eloise"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ \"Sorry, El.\" you send her an apologetic smile, pointing at the fridge in your hand. She smiles back at you, but shakes her head, looking a bit disappointed. ","\n","^Next time, you tell yourself. Today you just want to get over with the market as soon as possible, get back home and wait for the Diver to return.","\n",{"->":"go_to_stand"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"eloise":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"talkedToEloise","re":true},"^\"Hey, you. Haven't seen you in a while\" - Eloise looks up at you as you approach her stand.","\n","ev","str","^Complain a little","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Say nothing","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^You haven't been much fun lately, complaining often. But you know Eloise is a good friend and will listen to your annoyances anytime you need.","\n","^\"Slow week. Again, not much fish... I just stayed home, fixing the nets and all.\"","\n",{"->":"eloise_2"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n","^You just shrug. She knows, everybody knows, why you haven't visited the market lately. Not enough fish.","\n",{"->":"eloise_2"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"eloise_2":[["^She's smiling, looking up at you, her eyes squinting in the sun.","\n","^\"Just wanted to give you a heads up. You know these foreigners staying at Adele's, right?\"","\n","ev","str","^Nod","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Shrug","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"eloise_2_nod"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"eloise_2_shrug"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"eloise_2_nod":["^You nod. You know of them. Haven't actually met them and you're not really curious to.","\n",{"->":"eloise_2_2"},{"#f":1}],"eloise_2_shrug":["^You shrug. Even if you have heard about them, you haven't given them any thought.","\n",{"->":"eloise_2_2"},{"#f":1}],"eloise_2_2":[["^\"They really want to buy souvenirs, you know? Funny lot. They must be really desparate, they even bought some shells, can you imagine? Like, do these city folks don't know they can just go to the beach and pick some up, for free?\"","\n","ev","str","^It's funny","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^It's irritating","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^You smile, shaking your head with disbelief. \"What a bunch of clowns.\", you say, jokingly. Eloise laughs.","\n",{"->":"eloise_3"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n","^You frown. \"What a bunch of clowns.\", you say, angrily. Eloise nods, but you can tell she finds it funny.","\n",{"->":"eloise_3"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"eloise_3":[["^\"Anyway, just letting you know. They are eager to buy stuff and they're paying good money. Maybe you could sell them whatever the Diver drags out of the waters, huh? Might be some good business there, y'know.","\n","ev","str","^Not selling them anything","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Maybe...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"opposeEloise","re":true},"^\"I just want them off of this island, you know? Not gonna sell them anything, they might want to stay longer or something. Not taking any chances.\"","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"hasPearl"},true,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You feel the Pearl in your pocket. It's cold. Weirdly heavy.","\n","^You know you need to protect it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.14"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Eloise smiles but you feel she disapproves. The whole village is worried about the shack. About you and the Diver.","\n",{"->":"bye_eloise"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n","^\"Let me think about it...\", you say, still a lot of doubt in your voice.","\n","^Her smile widens.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"hasPearl"},true,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You feel the Pearl in your pocket. How much would these people be willing to pay for it?","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.12"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"bye_eloise"},"done","done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"bye_eloise":[["^\"Gotta go, El. You should put a hat on, it's scorching.\"","\n","^She whistles at you as you turn around. Throws something at you...","\n","ev","str","^Try to catch","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",0,1,"rnd","/ev",{"temp=":"catch_success"},"\n","ev",{"VAR?":"catch_success"},1,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You automatically reach out your hand and your fingers firmly grab a big, ripe apple.","\n","^\"Good catch!\", she laughs.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.15"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^The fridge is a bit too heavy and you stamble as you reach your hand to catch what appears to be an apple. You miss it and it falls on the ground down your feet.","\n","^\"Ha, need to work on those reflexes, old lady!\", she laughs.","\n","^You pick it up and dust it off.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.15"},null]}],"nop","\n","^You take a huge bite of the apple. It's cold, sweet and juicy.","\n","^Good old El. You've missed her.","\n",{"->":"go_to_stand"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"go_to_stand":[["ev","str","^Go to your stand","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"your_stand"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"your_stand":[["^You see somebody at your stand as you approach it.","\n","^A young couple, wearing plain white clothes, with a small dog on a long leash. They look relaxed, chatting and eating ice cream they probably bought from Fred's truck.","\n","^\"Can I help you?\" You ask, as you open the fridge, putting the ice and the fish on your stand.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"talkedToEloise"},true,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Some of them are already smelly, not good for sell anymore. You took too long. You get even more irritated and angry. What a fucking day.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.12"},null]}],"nop","\n","^The young woman offers her hand.","\n","ev","str","^Shake her hand","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Ignore it","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ You shake it. ","\n","^\"Nice to meet you, Fisher.\", she says.","\n","^You just nod quietly, waiting for what they have to say.","\n",{"->":"offer"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ You leave her hanging, but she doesn't look fazed. ","\n","^\"Nice to meet you.\", she says anyway.","\n","^Arms crossed, you wait.","\n",{"->":"offer"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"offer":[["^\"We're leaving tomorrow\", she says, \"and we'd like to have a token to remind us of the most wonderful time we've had on this island!\"","\n","ev","str","^Look at the guy","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Keep looking at her","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Her husband is standing silently beside her. He looks rather bored.","\n","^The woman clears her throat, trying to get your attention.","\n",{"->":"offer_2"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^She has a friendly look on her face but there's something about her that you don't like. Maybe you're prejudiced. Maybe it's a hunch.","\n",{"->":"offer_2"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"offer_2":[["^You can see other village folk looking at them. They don't love them either, but the village needs their money.","\n",["^\"Do you have any treasures you can spare?\" she smiles at you.","\n","ev","str","^Sell the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Don't sell the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^You really don't want to sell them anything.","\n","^But...","\n","^You need the money. That's a fact and there's no going around this.","\n",["ev","str","^Sell the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Changed your mind. Don't sell.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^The Sea provides you with fish, seaweed, shelter.","\n","^It will understand. It will forgive.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^There's plenty of pearls in the sea.","\n","^What's one less?","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n","^But... it feels wrong. On many levels.","\n",["ev","str","^Sell the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You...just...can't","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You close your eyes for a second.","\n","^\"Forgive me, oh Sea. I have to.\"","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^You hesitate. You've done the math and you see no other way.","\n","^You have to sell it. You need their money. You have to do it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"sell_the_pearl"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You are scared, for yourself, for the Diver. You know the shack's not safe. You know you're short on money.","\n","^Still, the wrath of the Sea scares you more.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^No. You will not bend your principles.","\n","^You've been in tight situations before. You will manage.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"dont_sell"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^The Sea will help you find another way. You can't sell its gifts to strangers.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^There's gotta be another way.","\n","^These people... they can just come and take whatever they please. They feel like trouble.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n","^But... you really do need the money. How else will you keep the Diver safe?","\n",["ev","str","^Sell the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You...just..can't","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You feel trapped. You feel there's no other way.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You close your eyes for a second.","\n","^\"Forgive me, oh Sea. I have to.\"","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^You hesitate. You've done the math and you see no other way.","\n","^You have to sell it. You need their money. You have to do it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"sell_the_pearl"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You are scared, for yourself, for the Diver. You know the shack's not safe. You know you're short on money.","\n","^Still, the wrath of the Sea scares you more.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^No. You will not bend your principles.","\n","^You've been in tight situations before. You will manage.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"dont_sell"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^You really don't want to sell them anything.","\n","^But... you also really do need the money.","\n","^How else will you keep the Diver safe?","\n",["ev","str","^Sell the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^There's got to be another way.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^You go through everything once more. The generator. The shack. The risk the Diver is taking every day.","\n",["ev","str","^Sell the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You...just..can't","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You feel trapped. You feel there's no other way.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You close your eyes for a second.","\n","^\"Forgive me, oh Sea. I have to.\"","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^You hesitate. You've done the math and you see no other way.","\n","^You have to sell it. You need their money. You have to do it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"sell_the_pearl"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You are scared, for yourself, for the Diver. You know the shack's not safe. You know you're short on money.","\n","^Still, the wrath of the Sea scares you more.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^No. You will not bend your principles.","\n","^You've been in tight situations before. You will manage.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"dont_sell"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^No. You said it before, you say it again.","\n","^The gifts of the Sea are not to be sold.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^You will think of something.","\n","^You want nothing to do with them. Fuck those guys.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n","^But... you really do need the money. How else will you keep the Diver safe?","\n",["ev","str","^Sell the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You...just..can't","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You feel trapped. You feel there's no other way.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You close your eyes for a second.","\n","^\"Forgive me, oh Sea. I have to.\"","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^You hesitate. You've done the math and you see no other way. You have to sell it. You need their money. You have to do it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"sell_the_pearl"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You are scared, for yourself, for the Diver. You know the shack's not safe. You know you're short on money.","\n","^Still, the wrath of the Sea scares you more.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^No. You will not bend your principles.","\n","^You've been in tight situations before. You will manage.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"dont_sell"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],{"#f":1}],"dont_sell":[["^Fuck those guys.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"hasPearl"},true,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You feel the pearl cold and surprisingly heavy in your pocket. You know this was the right thing to do.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^Be nice","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Be rude","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^\"As you can see, I am a fisherwoman. I sell fish. If that's what you're interested in, be my guest. These are fresh, good fish. There's nothing else I have for you.\"","\n","^The guy shrugs and he turns away. The wet, seaweed-y smell is clearly something he does not enjoy. He is counting hours until they can finally leave this island behind.","\n","^The woman looks disappointed. She gives you a long, lingering look.","\n","^\"No thanks. We're good\". They turn around and go.","\n",["ev","str","^Finish your day","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"finish_day"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^\"I'm busy. Don't have anything to sell you and have no time for small talk. Goodbye\". The guy looks pissed. He mutters something under his breath. He's done and wants to go.","\n","^She tries to maintain the polite expression, but you can see she's pissed too.","\n","^They walk away, without a word.","\n",["ev","str","^Finish your day","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"finish_day"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"finish_day":["^Feeling you did the right thing, you stay at your stand. It's already afternoon when you're all wrapped up and ready to head back home.","\n",{"->":"back_home"},{"#f":1}],"sell_the_pearl":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"soldPearl","re":true},"^\"Well, maybe there's something I've got that could be interesting for you...\", you say, with a heavy heart.","\n","^The woman's eyes widen with excitement.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"hasPearl"},true,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You've got the pearl with you.","\n",{"->":"show_pearl"},{"->":".^.^.^.15"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^\"I just need to go get it. You stay here, will ya?\", you ask, looking at your feet. \"It'll just take a moment.\"","\n",{"->":"back_to_shack_for_pearl"},{"->":".^.^.^.15"},null]}],"nop","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"show_pearl":[["ev","str","^Show them the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Tell them about the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^You take the pearl out of your pocket. Deep inside you feel this is not the right thing to do but you try to keep these thoughts quiet. You just want to be done with this.","\n",{"->":"give_them_the_pearl_2"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^\"Pearls. We've got some pearls that...\"","\n","^The woman doesn't wait for you to finish the sentence. \"Show it to me!\", she says in demanding voice.","\n",{"->":"give_them_the_pearl"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"back_to_shack_for_pearl":[["ev","str","^Walk slowly","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Run","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^You slowly walk back to your shack, heart sinking in your chest, arguing with yourself one last time. Was this the right decision? You admire the view. The sky is so blue it's melting with the sea. No horizon, just one vast azure plain.","\n",{"->":"get_pearl"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Running to the shack, you try not to think about it. You're scared you might change your mind again.","\n","^You keep looking at the ground. For some reason you don't want to look at the Sea.","\n",{"->":"get_pearl"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"get_pearl":[["^The shack lookes older and more miserable than in the morning, and you know it's not safe. You really need the money.The pearl is still on the table, where the Diver left it. You gently pick it up and put it in your pocket.","\n","^The couple is waiting for you at your stand.","\n","ev","str","^Show the pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^  You show them the pearl. ",{"->":"give_them_the_pearl_2"},"\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"give_them_the_pearl":[["ev","str","^Take the pearl out","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ You take the pearl out of your pocket.","\n",{"->":"give_them_the_pearl_2"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"give_them_the_pearl_2":[["^It looks beautiful, completely out of this place. Elegant, shiny, expensive. A loud gasp escapes her mouth.","\n","^The woman claps, nearly jumping with joy. \"That's exactly what I was thinking of! It even exceeds my expectations, to be honest!\", she reaches out for the pearl.","\n","^Even the guy looks impressed.","\n","^You slowly place the pearl into her palm.","\n","ev","str","^Someone's staring","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"eloise_stare"},"\n","done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"eloise_stare":[["^You can feel Eloise's stare on your back.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"talkedToEloise"},true,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"opposeEloise"},true,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^She probably thinks you're a coward, quick to bend your back. Why did you argue with her earlier if you're eager to sell the pearls anyway?","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^You hope she approves. She understands the tight spot you're in. She's not judging.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^You wonder what she thinks about this whole mess. Does she approve? You wished you had talked to her before.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n","^What happens next, you don't clearly remember.","\n","^You get the money, the couple even buys some fish. You feel like you're on auto-pilot, dissociating. The couple says their goodbyes and they quickly walk away.","\n","ev","str","^Go home","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ You sell the rest of the fish and head back home.","\n",{"->":"back_home"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"back_home":[["^You get back and head to the porch again. Listening to the soothing sound of the waves, you're impatiently waiting to see the Diver's boat on the horizon.","\n","^Your limbs feel heavy, whole body tense. You strech on an well-worn armchair and close your eyes for a quick second. You doze off.","\n","ev","str","^Wake up","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"wake_up"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"wake_up":["ev",{"VAR?":"soldPearl"},true,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"big_tide"},{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"storm"},{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence"},{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],"nop","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"storm":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"isStorm","re":true},"^The sudden sound of the wind howling wakes you up. It sounds a little like a wounded animal. Thick, dark clouds cover the sky. It's drizzling. The waves crash against the shack's long legs, making the whole building shake dangerously. Everything feels like it could collapse into cold, dark waters at any moment.","\n","^You clench your teeth. It's not supposed to be this stormy today.","\n","ev","str","^Save the fishnets","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Save the generator","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"isGeneratorDown","re":true},"^Quick on your feet, you run to pull the fishnets out of the water. You're almost done, when you hear the electric hiss. The generator. Some cable must have been torn out. The lights go off. You're out of electricity.","\n",{"->":"storm2"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"isFishnetsDown","re":true},"^Quick on your feet, you climb up to the generator on the roof. You need to disconnect any loose cables before the wind torns them out.","\n","^The whole shack sways under your feet. You manage to fix everything up, but as you're climbing down the ladder you hear a loud crack.","\n","^Fishnets. Wooden arms holding them must have crashed because of the strong waves. No fishnets means no food and no money, but right now, you don't really care.","\n",{"->":"storm2"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"storm2":[["ev","str","^Check the shack","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Go back inside","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You take a look around, but it really doesn't feel safe, walking around in this weather. The wooden floors are slippery and the whole building sways back and forth on the legs weakened by the time and waves.","\n","^You're not even sure if this miserable hut will survive the night.","\n",["ev","str","^Go inside","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"storm2_inside"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Nothing else you can do now. For the first time in ages, you feel genuinely frightened. You slowly get back inside, wooden floors extremely slippery and the whole building swaying back and forth on the legs weakened by the time and waves.","\n",["ev","str","^Close the door","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"storm2_inside"},"\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"storm2_inside":[["^You close the door behind you, the wind and the waves roaring outside.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"isGeneratorDown"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You find some candles, light them. Warm candle light makes the shack a little less scary, but you still don't feel safe.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^You turn on the lights. You thank yourself you saved the generator. Warm lamp light makes the shack a little less scary, but you still don't feel safe.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^Where is she?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"storm_diver_missing"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"storm_diver_missing":["^You take a few deep breaths. In and out. You need to calm down.","\n","^Slowly, with the adrenaline going down, the reality kicks in. She's alone, at the Sea, in a small, wooden boat. Your heart is pounding so loud, you almost don't hear the wind anymore. You have to do something.","\n",{"->":"diver_missing"},"done",{"#f":1}],"big_tide":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"isTide","re":true},"^You slowly open your eyes. The sun is setting down. The sky is orange again, a beautiful shade of a ripe grapefruit, almost red. It's so peaceful and quiet.","\n","^A little... too quiet?","\n","^The silence jolts you out of your slumber completely. You look at the Sea.","\n","^You have never seen a tide like this. You can't see any water. It looks like it's long kilometers of sand and mud. Seaweed and trash laying in the sun already start to smell bad.","\n","^Fish, clams, crabs - everything dead or slowly dying in the sun.","\n","^You feel sick.","\n","ev","str","^Run to the toilet","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Grab a bucket","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^You get to the toilet just in time. The horrible stench is burning your nostrils and you throw up in the bathroom. You can't think straight, thoughts running through your head.","\n","^What the hell is going on?","\n",{"->":"tide_diver_missing"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n","^The horrible stench is burning your nostrils. You grab a bucket and throw up inside.","\n","^You can't think straight, thoughts running through your head. What the hell is going on?","\n",{"->":"tide_diver_missing"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"tide_diver_missing":[["ev","str","^The Diver...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^It takes you a good minute to come back to your senses. Why hasn't the Diver returned yet? Is she okay? You feel the heart pounding heavily in your chest.","\n","^Something is really wrong. She's alone, somewhere in this terrible, decaying desert.","\n","^Suddenly, it dawns on you. It's all your fault. The wrath of the Sea is aimed directly at you, you selling the pearl to these people who don't understand nor respect the Sea. You need to get it back and ask the Sea for forgiveness.","\n",{"->":"diver_missing"},"end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence":[["^You wake up, not sure how long you've been asleep. The waves are still rocking the shack, almost like a crib. You stretch in the armchair, well-rested and warm.","\n","ev","str","^Check the fishnets","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Check the mail","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"fishnets_check"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"mail_check"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"fishnets_check":[["^You go and pull the fishnets out of the water. At this point, you're kind of used to seeing empty nets. Today was, again, not a good day. You sigh.","\n","ev","str","^What's the time?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"silence_diver_missing"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"mail_check":[["^You go out of the shack and check the mailbox outside. There's a postcard from your sister and an electricity bill. You sigh. They just keep on coming.","\n","ev","str","^What's the time?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"silence_diver_missing"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_diver_missing":["^You glance at your watch. The Diver... she should have returned home by now.","\n","^You look at the Sea again. It's calm and it's not really frightening, but you feel a cold creeping up your spine. Where is she? You feel anxious. What should you do?","\n",{"->":"diver_missing"},"done",{"#f":1}],"diver_missing":["^Trying to stay calm, you go through the options in your head.","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"isStorm"},true,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"storm_decisions"},{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"isTide"},true,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"tide_decisions"},{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence_decisions"},{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","done",{"#f":1}],"storm_decisions":[[["ev",{"^->":"storm_decisions.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^This storm... It's unnatural. Were you wrong all along? Suddenly you feel like it's your fault. You need to do something to make the Sea forgive you. ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"storm_decisions.0.1.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^It's just a storm. Huge, powerful storm, but nothing otherworldy. You have to rescue the Diver, but you know you can't do it yourself. You need to ask for help. ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"storm_decisions.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"first_converted"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"storm_decisions.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.1.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"villagers_help_find_diver"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"tide_decisions":[["ev","str","^It's something you need to do on your own","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You can't do it on your own. You need to ask for help","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"get_pearl_back_yourself"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n",{"->":"villagers_help_get_back_pearl"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_decisions":["ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence_believer_decisions"},{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence_sceptic_decisions"},{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],"nop","\n","done",{"#f":1}],"silence_believer_decisions":[["ev","str","^You need to go and find the Diver. She might be in danger","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You feel that you must ask the Sea for her safe return. Give it something as a token of your belief","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"rescue_diver_yourself"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n",{"->":"believer_offering"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_sceptic_decisions":[["ev","str","^You need to go and find the Diver. She might be in danger","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^She’s been on the Sea longer than you’ve even known her. You want to help, but barging in might only put you both at risk. You choose to trust her.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"rescue_diver_yourself"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n",{"->":"wait_for_diver"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"first_converted":[["^\"I'm sorry, I'm sorry...\" you mutter under your breath. The pearl's gone, but there must be something else you can offer in exchange for her safe return.","\n","ev","str","^Get offering","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"choose_offering"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"storm_offering":[["^Clutching ","ev",{"VAR?":"offeringType"},"out","/ev","^ in your hand, you run back to the porch. The weather did not change. The torrential storm is squalling, shack swaying dangerously.","\n","ev","str","^No need for words. Give the offering silently","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Say something. Explain yourself","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"silent_offering"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"loud_offering"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silent_offering":[["^There's nothing to be said. You know you did wrong. You're sorry.","\n","^Hoping the Sea will understand, you open your palm and the ","ev",{"VAR?":"offeringType"},"out","/ev","^ vanishes in the waves. Exhausted, you get back to the kitchen, looking outside the window. Now what?","\n","ev","str","^Look through the window","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Sit at the table","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"window_before_mermaid"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"table_before_mermaid"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"window_before_mermaid":[["^You don't know what to do. You keep looking at the Sea through the window, hoping you'll see the familiar silhouette on the horizon, but the rain is still pouring, wind roaring, hard to see anything. Minutes feel like hours.","\n","ev","str","^You feel ... dry","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"turning_into_mermaid"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"table_before_mermaid":[["^You sit at the table, elbows resting on the wood. The Sea outside is still roaring dangerously, the walls creak like they might come apart.","\n","ev","str","^You feel ... dry","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"turning_into_mermaid"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"loud_offering":["^\"I am sorry!\" you shout, barely audible in the tempest. \"I really am. I think I understand now. I will not doubt you again, I promise. Just... give her back\"","\n","^You open your palm and the ","ev",{"VAR?":"offeringType"},"out","/ev","^ vanishes in the waves.","\n","^Exhausted, you get back to the kitchen, looking outside the window. Now what?","\n",{"->":"turning_into_mermaid"},"done",{"#f":1}],"turning_into_mermaid":[["^Suddenly you feel parched, almost like you havent' taken a sip of water in ages. You keep scratching your arms and legs.","\n","^It's getting unbearable. Suddenly you just want to immerse yourself in the cold, dark water to make it stop.","\n","ev","str","^Jump into the Sea","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^What? It's raining outside. Just get out","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"sea_jump"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"rain_outside"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"sea_jump":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"didJumpIntoSea","re":true},"^Feeling like you no longer control your body, you step oustide, into the storm. You don't hesitate, guided by an instinct, diving into black Sea, waves swallowing you whole instantly.","\n",{"->":"storm_fisher_mermaid_ending"},"done",{"#f":1}],"rain_outside":["^Jumping into the Sea? Why would you even think that? You feel you're descending into madness already. Without a raincoat, you step outside, grab the porch rail and feel the raindrops on your face. You're completely soaked  almost immediately. You sigh with relief, storm raging around you.","\n",{"->":"storm_fisher_mermaid_ending"},"done",{"#f":1}],"villagers_help_find_diver":[["^You know you can't do it yourself. You need help.","\n","^You run out of the shack. The solid ground under your feet gives you some reassurance.","\n","ev","str","^Run to the village","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"village_arrive"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"village_arrive":[["^No time to think, you sprint towards the village. The pouring rain has turned the path into a muddy river, slowing you down, your shoes sinking in the clay.","\n","^Finally, you reach the first buildings. You see warm light spilling out of the windows as everyone has taken shelter inside. You head towards the village center, into a small square with a bell.","\n","ev","str","^Ring the bell","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"the_bell"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"the_bell":[["^You leap torward it and pull the hanging rope with all your strenght.","\n","^A loud, low-pitched metallic sound cuts through the rain. Bell swings back and forth on its wooden frame, calling out to the villagers.","\n","^\"Help, please!\" you cry, not sure if you can outshout the bell. People peak out through the windows, you see them grabbing raincoats and hurrying outside.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"the_bell.0.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^\"I need your help. She's missing, and the storm, she's in danger...\"",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"the_bell.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"village_decision"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"village_decision":[["^You fall to your knees, feeling exhausted. Around you, voices shout out, planning the search. Gratitude fills your heart. You don't always see eye to eye, but you can count on each other in need. They don't ask question and willingly put themselves in danger to save her.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"talkedToEloise"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Eloise comes to you and gets you back to your feet.","\n","^\"Don't worry, we'll find her. She's the Sea's daughter, nothing will happen to her\", she says reassuringly.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",["ev",{"^->":"village_decision.0.8.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^\"We should take boats. She's out there somewhere.\" ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"village_decision.0.9.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^\"Boats are no use in this weather. Help me check our safe spots, she probably sailed there.\"",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"village_decision.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.8.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"boat_search"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"village_decision.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.9.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"safe_spot_search"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"boat_search":[["^The search group heads out fast, heading towards the harbour. There's six of you - that's two boats. You row in the storm, cutting throught the huge waves, shouting Diver's name, trying to outcry the wind and the rain.","\n","^The waves are rocking the boats, water pouring over the sides, lightnings illuminating around you.","\n","ev","str","^Check her usual spot","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Check the most dangerous passage","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"usual_spot_search"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"dangerous_passage_search"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"usual_spot_search":["^You steer in the direction she usually takes. You shout her name with all the might.","\n",{"->":"boat_search_final"},{"#f":1}],"dangerous_passage_search":["^You grip the sides of the boat tighter as you veer toward the jagged rocks. No one likes coming here, especially not in weather like this. But if she’s anywhere—","\n",{"->":"boat_search_final"},{"#f":1}],"boat_search_final":[["^\"There! A boat!\", somebody on the other boat cries.","\n","^You throw down your paddle, leaning out over the edge of the boat. You see the boat but it looks empty.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"talkedToEloise"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Eloise squeezes your hand. \"She's there\", she says.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Her boat rocks dangerously on the waves, but the first group reaches it first.","\n","ev","str","^Jump aboard","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Let someone else check","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"jump_to_her"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"somebody_else_jump"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"jump_to_her":["^Without hesitation, you jump aboard.","\n","^She's here. A warm feeling of relief washes over you. Before you know it, she's in your arms, shaking, soaking wet, but alive.","\n",{"->":"boat_search_final_2"},{"#f":1}],"somebody_else_jump":["^Somebody jumps aboard.","\n","^\"She's here!\", they yell and you feel overwhelmed with relief.","\n","^They help her get over to your boat and before you know it, she's in your arms, shaking, soaking wet, but alive.","\n",{"->":"boat_search_final_2"},{"#f":1}],"boat_search_final_2":[["ev","str","^Return to the village","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"rescue_diver_with_villagers"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"safe_spot_search":["^The search group heads out fast, heading towards the safe coves every village sailor knows. There's six of you, lanterns in hands, shouting Diver's name, trying to outcry the wind and the rain.","\n",{"->":"check_spots"},{"#f":1}],"check_spots":[["ev","str","^Check western spot","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Check northern spot","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Check eastern spot","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"spotsLeft"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"spotsLeft","re":true},"^You reach the western spot but it's empty. Waves crash on the rocky walls with collosal force. Your heart sinks in your chest.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"talkedToEloise"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^\"There's still ","ev",{"VAR?":"spotsLeft"},2,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ two ",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["^ one",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","^ left. Let's go\", Eloise says, squeezing your hand.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","^ ",{"->":".^.^.^"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"spotsLeft"},1,"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"spotsLeft","re":true},"^You make your way to the northern edge, breath catching from the climb and the cold. Nothing but wind and endless grey water.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^When you reach the eastern inlet, you hear a faint sound. You sprint ahead and look down the cliff.","\n",{"->":"found_her_in_eastern_spot"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"found_her_in_eastern_spot":[["^Frightened, wet, back glued to the rock face - she's there. Her eyes widen when she sees you and you can see the relief on her face.","\n","^Somebody throws down a rope and before you know it, she's in your arms, shaking but alive.","\n","ev","str","^Return to the village","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"rescue_diver_with_villagers"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"rescue_diver_with_villagers":["^Your mind goes blank as you all head back to the village. The storm is still raging as you make your way back.","\n","^Somebody offers to host you for the night and you gladly accept the offer. You both fall asleep in a second, exhausted, the stress finally lifting up.","\n",{"->":"storm_tourists_ending"},"done",{"#f":1}],"get_pearl_back_yourself":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"isAlone","re":true},"^Wasting no time, you run out of the shack.","\n","ev","str","^Take the bike","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Run to the village","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"bike_to_village_tide"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"run_to_village_tide"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"bike_to_village_tide":["^Your old bike is propped up against the tree. You hop on it and head towards the village. On the rocky path it is obvious that the tires are completely flat. You try stepping harder on the pedals but you lose your balance on the uphill and fall.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"bruisedLeg","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"isAlone"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"village_tide_alone"},{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"village_tide_together"},{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],"nop","\n","done",{"#f":1}],"run_to_village_tide":["^Your old bike is propped up against the tree, but you're not sure if it's good to use. You just sprint towards the village.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"isAlone"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"village_tide_alone"},{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"village_tide_together"},{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],"nop","\n","done",{"#f":1}],"village_tide_alone":[["ev","str","^Go to Adele's","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^You reach Adele's house in a few minutes. You storm in.","\n","^\"Where are they?\", you ask in a loud voice. Adele lifts her head at you from behind the counter, surprised.","\n","^\"The tourists? Oh honey, you just missed them!\", she smiles. \"I think Frank has sailed them out  like an hour ago\". She frowns. \"He's not back. Weird. Maybe something has held him in the town?\".","\n","^You don't even let her finish, storming out of her inn.","\n",["ev","str","^Return to your shack","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"back_home_tide"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"back_home_tide":["^You ran back, as fast as you can, wishing the situation has magically resolved itself.","\n","^Unfortunately -- the seabed is still barren, smell unbearable, air scorching hot.","\n",{"->":"tide_offering_decision"},"done",{"#f":1}],"tide_offering_decision":[["^Deep inside, you know it's your fault. It's the pearl. You shouldn't have sold it.","\n","^How can you make this right?","\n","^There must be something you can offer in exchange for the Diver.","\n","ev","str","^Check your treasures","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"choose_offering"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"tide_offering":[["^You're not sure how to give the ","ev",{"VAR?":"offeringType"},"out","/ev","^ to the Sea, it's suddenly so far away from you. You climb down the wooden ladder and let yourself down on the smelly sand.","\n","^You look around. The desert around you scares you and you can barely breathe because of the muddy stench.","\n","^\"Please, forgive me\", you say one more time. You place the ","ev",{"VAR?":"offeringType"},"out","/ev","^ in the sand.","\n","^All you can do now is wait.","\n","ev","str","^Get back to the shack","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"tide_alone_ending"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"villagers_help_get_back_pearl":[["^Wasting no time, you run out of the shack.","\n","ev","str","^Run to the village","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"run_to_village_tide"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"village_tide_together":[["^\"Eloise! Need your help!\", you yell, knocking on her door.","\n","^She opens the door quickly, surprised.","\n","^\"What's going on?\", she asks. She sniffs and wrinkles her nose. \"What's that smell?\"","\n","ev","str","^Help me get the pearl back","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^\"I need to get the pearl back from them. No time to explain now. Just, trust me, okay?\"","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"talkedToEloise"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^She studies your face, not entirely convinced, but nods.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^She still looks a bit annoyed at you. Giving you a long look, she finally nods.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.8"},null]}],"nop","\n","^\"They left already, with Frank, you know\". You feel your heart sinking in your chest. You look down on your feet. All hope's lost.","\n","^\"Don't you worry\", Eloise says, grinning. \"I've got an idea. Follow me\".","\n",["ev","str","^Follow Eloise","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"eloise_help_tide"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"eloise_help_tide":[["^You both run to Adele's inn. She's not behind the counter. Eloise winks at you, goes behind it and picks up the only phone in the village.","\n","^\"I'll handle it. What should Frank do when he gets the pearl back?\", she asks, dialing the number.","\n","ev","str","^Throw in the water","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Bury on the beach","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^\"Just... throw it in the water\".","\n","^If the Sea is still there, you think to yourself.","\n",{"->":"eloise_takes_care"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n","^\"Just... bury it on the beach\".","\n","^There's no Sea left, you think to yourself.","\n",{"->":"eloise_takes_care"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"eloise_takes_care":[["^\"Consider it done\", Eloise says. You step outside, leaving her alone. You trust her. She'll handle it.","\n","ev","str","^Wait for Eloise outside","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"village_go_to_beach"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"village_go_to_beach":[["^\"Done!\", you hear her voice in a few minutes. She steps outside the building, smiling with pride.","\n","^You notice more people going out of their houses, smelling the unbearable stench.","\n","^\"What's going on?\", Eloise asks.","\n","^\"I'll show you. You all need to see this.\"","\n","ev","str","^Go to the Sea","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"village_go_to_beach_2"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"village_go_to_beach_2":[["^You all go down to your house near the cliff, and down, to the beach. Is it still a beach if there's no water? The Sea looks so far away, the dirty sand, the rotting carcasses. Terrible, horrendous sight.","\n","^Everyone looks at the horizon with horror. Nobody says a thing. There's tears, somebody throws up. You feel sick too.","\n","^\"Is this all because of the pearl?\", Eloise asks.","\n","ev","str","^Yes","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ \"Yes\", you nod.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"opposeEloise"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^\"You were right\", you can see blood leaving her face. \"You didn't want to sell it to them and I convinced you...\"","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^\"I convinced you to sell it to them...\", you can see blood leaving her face. \"I didn't know...\"","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],"nop","\n","^You want to console her, tell her it's not her fault -- but you're interrupted by a short, high pitched scream.","\n",["ev","str","^Go check what's going on","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"mermaid_found_tide"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"mermaid_found_tide":[["^You turn around and see a figure lying on the sand in the distance. It's her, you think to yourself, sprinting to get to her. Quickly, you realize, it's not the Diver.","\n","^She lies on the sand, pale grey skin, seaweed in her white hair. Her lower body glistens in the sun, dark blue scales, translucent fins tweaching weakly.","\n","^It's a mermaid.","\n","^You look at the people around you. Nobody utters a word. Is this the sun? The stress? Are you all hallucinating stuff?","\n","^Suddenly, she opens her eyes. She seems to be breathing fine, but she's drying out in the sun. She mouths something, but no sound comes out.","\n","^Eloise first comes to her senses.","\n","^\"Alright people, we need to help her.","\n","ev","str","^Take her home","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Drive her to the water","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ \"Let's take her to my place. Put her in the tub\", you hear yourself say.","\n",{"->":"mermaid_home_save"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ \"We need to get her to the water, now. The Sea is too far away now, we need a vehicle\", you hear yourself say.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"isCarSave","re":true},{"->":"mermaid_car_save"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"mermaid_home_save":[["^You run back to the shack, grab some sheets and you start drawing the bath with cold water.","\n","^Others help wrap her in the sheets, gently pick her up and bring her into your house. She sighs with relief. She says something, but you still cannot hear a word.","\n","^\"What do we do with... it?\", you hear someone say. She's safe now, but she cannot stay in your bathtub forever and you're not really sure what to do next.","\n","ev","str","^Decide what to do with her","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You all gather in your kitchen, silent.","\n","^\"How far is the Sea?\", you ask. \"Will we be able to bring her back?\"","\n","^\"Not like that. We need to carry her in water. Otherwise it's too hot for her, I'm afraid\", Eloise says. \"Let's figure something out, people!\"","\n",{"->":"mermaid_barrel_save"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"mermaid_barrel_save":[["^People rush out your shack, and soon they're back, rolling a fish barrel. It is old -- rusty hoops, wood green with algae -- but should be enough to keep the mermaid safe.","\n","ev","str","^Check on the Sea","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You go out on the porch, anxiously looking at the Sea, unusually far in the distance. It's seems to be getting closer, but it's probably just an illusion, something you desperately want to be true. You hear people pour water inside the barrel.","\n",["ev","str","^Go back inside","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^When you go back she's already inside, kind of. She's very slim, but her long, muscular tail could not fit inside, so it's hanging unnaturaly. It takes four people to bring the barrel down, but she doesn't wake. Someone is pouring water on her, someone else keeps an open umbrella to give her some shadow.","\n",["ev","str","^Get her back to the Sea","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"mermaid_back_to_sea"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"mermaid_back_to_sea":[["^The beach is wide and quiet, but the terrible smell is lingering on the sand, making it hard to breathe. The barrel sits on a wooden trolley and you take turns pulling and pushing. You get to the water much faster than you anticipated -- it reaches your shoes and the barrel soon starts to gently float.","\n","ev","str","^Put the mermaid in the water","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"put_mermaid_water"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"mermaid_car_save":[["^Somebody sprints back to the village to get the car, you go back to your shack to get some wet towels. When you get back to the mermaid, the car is already there. You wrap her in the towels and together put her inside.","\n","^\"Let's go\", you quietly say. You head towards where the sea used to be. The mermaid looks scared, breathing with difficulty, but you can see the wet towels gave her some relief. Finally, you reach the water.","\n","ev","str","^Put the mermaid in the water","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"put_mermaid_water"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"put_mermaid_water":[["^Trying to be gentle, you take her out of the ","ev",{"VAR?":"isCarSave"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ vehicle",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["^barrel",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","^, bring her to the water and put her down. For a while, she just lays on the shore, waves washing her, colours coming back to her cheeks. Says something, mute. Then, with a few swift motions she crawls further into the Sea and finally starts swimming. She looks smaller and smaller, her fins barely visible in the shining water.","\n","ev","str","^Get back","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You get back to the car, silent, and you notice the water level has risen, now almost reaching the car doors.","\n","^\"I think whatever we did, it worked\", Eloise says. \"The Sea is coming back. We should hurry now\".","\n","^You drive back to the beach, everybody's waiting. \"She's okay. The Sea is fine, too. It'll return soon\", you say, exhausted.","\n","^A quiet sound of relief goes around in the crowd.","\n",["ev","str","^Go back to your shack","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"tide_together_ending"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"wait_for_diver":[["^You feel as if the clock has slowed down, almost stopped. You try to keep yourself busy, reminding yourself the Diver is really good at what she does. She soon will be back.","\n","ev","str","^Check fishnets","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Check generator","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"silence_check_fishnets"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"silence_check_generator"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_check_fishnets":[["^Fishnets look fine, but you still take some time repairing the threads here and there. Then you check the wooden crane, add some nails here and there. The sun is slowly going down and it's getting dark.","\n","ev","str","^Go back inside","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"keep_waiting"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_check_generator":[["^The generator hums unevenly. You add some fuel, clean the air filter, tighten loose bolts. It's old and you'll probably have to replace it soon, but now it works just fine. The sun is slowly going down and it's getting dark.","\n","ev","str","^Go back inside","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"check_her_notes"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"check_her_notes":[["^You need to keep yourself busy. You decide to check her workspace, and look for any hint on where she might have gone. Just in case she's not back by sunrise.","\n","^You go to her room. Her desk is messy as always. Papers, maps, drawings. Everything scattered around.","\n","^A small notebook catches your attention. It's full of pictures of mermaids-like creatures, lean monsters, scales on their long fish tails, hollow eyes, dark hair.","\n","^The notes are full of questions, strange patterns on the maps.","\n","^\"They're not monsters\", underlined with a thick stroke.","\n","ev","str","^The sun is rising","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"keep_waiting"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"keep_waiting":["^You've lost the track of time. You rush out of the shack, to the porch. The sky is grey, slowly turning orange.","\n",{"->":"diver_is_back"},{"#f":1}],"diver_is_back":[["^Sunrise illuminates the shack with a warm, orange glow. You hear a cracking noise. Somebody is climbing up the ladder.","\n","^She's back. In a flash she's in your arms.","\n","^\"I was so worried, don't know why, I knew you'll be back...\", you whisper, but she doesn't reply.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"diver_is_back.0.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^\"What happened?\"",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"diver_is_back.0.7.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^\"Were were you?\"",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"diver_is_back.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^You search her face, but she just stares past you. Still catching her breath. Still somewhere else.","\n",{"->":"breakfast"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"diver_is_back.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.7.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^You try to keep your voice soft, but it comes out sharper than you meant. She flinches, barely. Still says nothing.","\n",{"->":"breakfast"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"breakfast":[["^You sit her down at the table and go inside to get her something to eat.","\n","^Just like yesterday and the day before, you're soon both sitting at the table, hot coffee steaming from the chipped mugs, bread and butter.","\n","^She doesn't look at you, doesn't speak, just silently looks at the Sea.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"breakfast.0.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^\"What's wrong?\"",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"breakfast.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"whats_wrong"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"whats_wrong":[["^\"You won't believe me\", she says slowly, turning away. \"You will never understand\"","\n","^Cold feeling washes over you, running from the tip of your head, down to your toes. What happened to her?","\n","^\"I knew you wouldn't listen, you wouldn't sell anything to those tourists, so I just... I just wanted to make more money, you know? Just dive a bit further, go a bit deeper. And... I crossed the line\"","\n",["ev",{"^->":"whats_wrong.0.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","str","^quietly","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":22},{"s":["^\"Why did you do that?\" ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"whats_wrong.0.7.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","str","^angrily","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":22},{"s":["^\"Why did you do that?\" ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"whats_wrong.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"quiet_question"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"whats_wrong.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.7.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"angry_question"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"quiet_question":["^She finally looks at you, her eyes empty.","\n",{"->":"final_answer"},{"#f":1}],"angry_question":["^She finally looks at you, looking hurt.","\n",{"->":"final_answer"},{"#f":1}],"final_answer":[["^\"I just wanted to help. But... I almost drowed. Such an awful feeling, your lungs beg for oxygen, every cell of your body burns for air. For the first time I didn't feel safe in the water. It scared me.\"","\n","ev","str","^Listen quietly","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Take her hand","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"listen_quiet"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"take_her_hand"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"listen_quiet":["^You feel tears welling up inside you. The guilt is a stinging feeling in your chest.","\n",{"->":"diver_story"},{"#f":1}],"take_her_hand":["^You reach out slowly and take her hand. She doesn't pull away.","\n",{"->":"diver_story"},{"#f":1}],"diver_story":[["^\"And then I felt carried up, up to the surface, the sun, the air. I was alive again.\"","\n","^Long pause. You just wait.","\n","^\"Two of them saved me. Mermaids, sirens, sea monsters. They looked just like in the children's books, you know? They don't sing though. I think they're mute or maybe use some frequency we can't hear. They helped me.\"","\n","^She looks at you. You look down. She wants you to believe her, she needs you to believe her.","\n","ev","str","^You believe her","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You don't believe her","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"lie_mermaids"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"truth_mermaids"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"lie_mermaids":["^\"I believe you\", you say. You are not sure if you really, deep down. You want to. You try to sound sincere, but she hears the doubt in your voice.","\n","^She turns away, looking at the sea. You just sit in silence.","\n",{"->":"silence_sceptic_leave_ending"},{"#f":1}],"truth_mermaids":["^You want to tell her she probably drank a little too much salt water, that it's common to hallucinate when you're on the brink of dying. She was probably carried up by some kind of sea current. You've seen her notes and you're worried about her.","\n","^But you can't tell her that. She's too vulnerable and you don't want to make the things worse. You say nothing.","\n","^She turns away, looking at the sea. You just sit in silence.","\n",{"->":"silence_sceptic_leave_ending"},{"#f":1}],"rescue_diver_yourself":[["^You know you have to try and help her. There's her old boat, rusty engine might not work, but you will row if you have to. You feel adrenaline pumping through your vains, you get your things quickly and board the boat. It's small, the dry paint peeling off in several places.","\n","ev","str","^Start the engine","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"engine_start"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"engine_start":["^You pull the engine cable a few times, and finally, with several coughts and a lot of smoke, it starts. You head in the direction of the setting sun.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"believer"},{"VAR?":"sceptic"},">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence_sceptic_rescue"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"silence_sceptic_rescue":[["^Finally, you see a boat on the horizon. The engine is almost at its limit, weezing unpleasantly. You see the Diver sitting inside, knees under her chin, wet and distressed.","\n","ev","str","^What happened?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Are you okay?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Say nothing, just reach out to her.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"boat_found_ask"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"boat_found_care"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"boat_found_hand"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"boat_found_ask":[["^\"What happened?\", you ask, getting your boat as close to hers as possible.","\n","^She hesitates for a second, still not looking directly at you.","\n","^\"I almost drowned. Like, I almost died, you know?\", she says, her voice trembling with fear.","\n","^\"My lungs beg for oxygen, every cell of your body burned for air. For the first time I didn't feel safe in the water. I'm scared\".","\n","^You notice she is clutching the rope really tight, fingers almost white.","\n","ev","str","^Jump over to her boat","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Get her to your boat","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"jump_over"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n",{"->":"her_to_your_boat"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"boat_found_care":[["^\"Are you okay?\", you ask, getting your boat as close to hers as possible.","\n","^She looks at you, pale as a ghost.","\n","^\"No. I thought I was fine, I thought I know the Sea and I trusted it. I... I almost drowned, you know?\", she speaks slowly, struggling to make a sentence.","\n","^\"I wanted to go a bit deeper, stay down a bit longer. And suddenly it was all dark, I got pulled even further, didn't know which way is up, I...\", her voice cracks. She weeps.","\n","ev","str","^Jump over to her boat","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Get her to your boat","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"jump_over"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n",{"->":"her_to_your_boat"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"boat_found_hand":[["^You just reach out to her, getting your boat as close to hers as possible. You touch her arm.","\n","^She finally sees you, but for a moment she looks like she doesn't believe her eyes.","\n","^Then she says, her voice trembling: \"I almost died today. I thought I am safe here, in the Sea, in the water. I was wrong\"","\n","ev","str","^Jump over to her boat","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Get her to your boat","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"jump_over"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n",{"->":"her_to_your_boat"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"jump_over":[["^You jump over to her boat. She looks terrified when the boat starts rocking. She clutches the sides of the boats, her face pale with fear.","\n","^You hug her, trying to comfort her but her body is tense, stiff.","\n","ev","str","^Go back home","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"go_back_home_with_diver"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"her_to_your_boat":[["^You grab her hand and she stands up. You can see that she's scared. She doesn't want to stay on her boat.","\n","^You help her get inside yours. Hesitantly, she jumps over, then clings to you tightly, crying, trembling.","\n","ev","str","^Go back home","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"go_back_home_with_diver"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"go_back_home_with_diver":["^\"You're okay now, I'm here\", you say, still holding her. \"Let's go home\"","\n","^You feel she nods. You wrap her in a blanket and steer back.","\n",{"->":"silence_sceptic_rescue_ending"},{"#f":1}],"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue":[["^It's getting dark really fast and the tide is getting higher, waves crashing on your boat rock the boat uncontrollably. Suddenly, your rescue plan seems very stupid. You have no supplies, don't know where she might be, and, what's most important, you're really not good with boats.","\n","ev","str","^Try to turn back. You need a new plan","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Try to push forward. It's too late to turn back","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"silence_believer_turn_back"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"silence_believer_push_forward"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_believer_turn_back":[["^You curse under your breath and turn your boat around, hoping you've kept the right direction. It's getting darker, you can barely see a few feet ahead. Suddenly you feel really small, in a tiny boat, surrounded by a huge body of water.","\n","^Then, your boat crashes with full force into a rock you haven't noticed, throwing you overboard. Cold water swallows you whole, you don't know which way is up, darkness thickens around you.","\n","ev","str","^Try to swim up","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"mermaids_rescue_you"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_believer_push_forward":[["^You grit your teeth. It's too late to go back now, you're at the Sea, and the Diver needs your help. You can do this, just hang for a little bit longer.","\n","^Suddenly, a huge wave washes over your boat, covering it whole. It sways dangerously and the engine coughs, making one last long, sputtering, then dies.","\n","^You yank at the cord, time after time, more and more desperate and angry.","\n","^Your final pull is a bit too strong. The cord ruptures and the force pushes you into the cold water.","\n","ev","str","^Try to swim up","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"mermaids_rescue_you"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"mermaids_rescue_you":[["^The Sea swallows you hungrily. You try to fight back, but it's not letting you go, pulling you deeper and deeper.","\n","ev","str","^Try to fight","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Let the current carry you","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"fight_mermaids"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"let_go_mermaids"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"fight_mermaids":["^You try to swim up, now really sure which way is up. But you can't give up. Not now.","\n","^Just as your lungs begin to burn, beggin for oxygen, you feel something grabs your arm.","\n","^You scream, but it makes no sound under the water.","\n",{"->":"mermaids_rescue_you_2"},{"#f":1}],"let_go_mermaids":["^You stop resisting, let your body drift with the current.","\n","^Something brushes against your leg—then two hands catch you, gently, like you're being cradled.","\n",{"->":"mermaids_rescue_you_2"},{"#f":1}],"mermaids_rescue_you_2":[["^You open your eyes.","\n","^Shapes move in the dark water, silver scales, translucent fins, golden eyes.","\n","^They pull you out of the water. You gasp for air the second your head is above the surface. Strong arms move you up and place you safely back in your boat.","\n","^You lie down, exhausted, breathing heavily. You feel your boat is pushed swiftly, you feel safe - you know they are taking you home.","\n","ev","str","^Listen...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^As you drift, half-conscious, you hear it, soft and low. The mermaids singing, voices curling through the waves like a lullaby.","\n",{"->":"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue_ending"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"believer_offering":["^\"Are you mad with me? Why is that, didn't I believe and obey you?\" you mutter under your breath. \"Please, let the Diver come back safe.\"","\n",{"->":"choose_offering"},"done",{"#f":1}],"silence_sea_offering":[["^You head back to the porch, ","ev",{"VAR?":"offeringType"},"out","/ev","^ in your hand.","\n","ev","str","^Ask the Sea for forgiveness","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^\"Accept this offering. Please let her come back to me\", you say.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"offeringType"},"str","^amber","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence_amber"},{"->":".^.^.^.12"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence_pearl"},{"->":".^.^.^.12"},null]}],"nop","\n","done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_amber":[["^You hesitate for a moment. You remember when the Diver came back home with this one. She was so proud of herself. She said it preserves memories, traps time. \"It might even remember the dinosaurs, you know?\", she said, with a huge smile on her face.","\n","^When you open your palm, it feels as if the waves are reaching out to the amber. Your gift is not swallowed, not lost in the waves. It's accepted.","\n","ev","str","^Say your prayer","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^\"Wherever she is, let me follow\", you whisper one more time. You feel it in your chest. The Sea has accepted your devotion.","\n",{"->":"diver_is_back_silence"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_pearl":[["^You remember when the Diver came back home with this one. She was so proud of herself. It was so deep down, even she had problems getting it. It was her proudest memory, her biggest achievement.","\n","^With a heavy heart, you open your palm. It vanished in dark water instantly. The waves get higher for a moment, splashing heavily. It's accepted.","\n","ev","str","^Say your prayer","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^\"Wherever she is, let me follow\", you whisper one more time. You feel it in your chest. The Sea has accepted your devotion.","\n",{"->":"diver_is_back_silence"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"diver_is_back_silence":[["^You sit down at your table, where you were having a breakfast, just a few hours ago. Together.","\n","^Now the sun is setting down, it's getting dark. You're looking at the sea, shoulders heavy, waiting.","\n","^You lit the small lanterns around the porch. This is one of the small rituals you have -- she can see home from far away and she'll know you're waiting for her to come back.","\n","ev","str","^Keep looking at the horizon","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"keep_looking_at_horizon"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"keep_looking_at_horizon":[["^Suddenly, you catch a glimpse of something in the water. A silver sparkle, a wrinkle on the water. Is it just the moonlight, just a fish?","\n","^There's no boat around, it's dark and you're tired. You don't want to rush into a stupid decision. But... it looks like a person. The shape is advancing quickly in the water, a bit too quickly.","\n","ev","str","^Call out","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Hold your breath","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Your voice breaks across the waves. No answer.","\n",{"->":"silence_sea_offering_ending"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^You brace yourself. What if it's not her?","\n",{"->":"silence_sea_offering_ending"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"choose_offering":[["^The Diver collected more treasure's through the years you've lived together. In your bedroom, from under the bed, you retreive a small jewel case with a bunch of beautiful sea trinkets inside.","\n","ev","str","^Choose amber","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Choose pearl","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev","str","^amber","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"offeringType","re":true},{"->":"amber_offering"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev","str","^pearl","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"offeringType","re":true},{"->":"pearl_offering"},"done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"amber_offering":["ev",{"VAR?":"isGeneratorDown"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^A small golden piece of amber glows warmly in the candle light.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^A small golden piece of amber glows warmly in the flickering light.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","^It's translucent and you can see small air bubbles trapped inside it forever. It's radiant, almost magical. You remember exactly the day she brought it home. It was one of her first independent diving trips. She was so proud, and you were proud of her, too.","\n","^Yes. It will do.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"isStorm"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"storm_offering"},{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence_sea_offering"},{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],"nop","\n","done",{"#f":1}],"pearl_offering":["ev",{"VAR?":"isGeneratorDown"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^A small pearl glows in the candle light.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^A small pearl glows in the flickering light.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","^It's opalescent, cold and silver, almost metallic in appearance.","\n","^You remember exactly the day she brought it home. It was her birthday. You insisted you both stayed home and just relaxed, but she wanted to go. Dive not for fish, but for fun. That's how much she loved it. She was so happy - a birthday gift from the Sea herself. You almost felt a little bit jealous that it was a better present than what you've prepared that year.","\n","^Yes. It will do.","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"isStorm"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"storm_offering"},{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"isTide"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"tide_offering"},{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"silence_sea_offering"},{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],"nop","\n","done",{"#f":1}],"storm_fisher_mermaid_ending":[["ev",{"VAR?":"didJumpIntoSea"},true,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You feel like you can breathe again. You feel the oxygen flowing through your veins, muscles relax immediately. The water feels warm and safe.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^You fall down on a porch, the rain pouring on your skin. You feel a strange tingling, your legs feel numb. The rain brings you some comfort, but you still feel your breath is shallow, like you can't fill your veins with oxygen.","\n","^You lie down, eyes closed, rain drops ferociously stinging your skin.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^Open your eyes","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"open_your_eyes"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"open_your_eyes":[["^You open your eyes. Looking down you see a strong tail covered in dark blue scales, translucent fins  ","ev",{"VAR?":"didJumpIntoSea"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ flowing with the current. ",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["^ twitching in the air. ",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","^You move the tail, gently. It feels natural. Yours.","\n","^There's thousands of questions in your head, but a single thought sharpens. The Diver. She still needs you.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"didJumpIntoSea"},false,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Awkwardly, you crawl to the edge of the porch. With one swift motion, without hesitation, you throw yourself into the water, waves swallowing you whole instantly.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.18"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^Look for the Diver","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"mermaid_look_for_the_diver"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"mermaid_look_for_the_diver":[["^Unsure at first, you start swimming. It feels so easy, so natural. You quickly gain speed, piercing through the dark waters.","\n","ev","str","^Check her favourite spot","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Check the most dangerous passage","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"favourite_spot"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"dangerous_passage"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"favourite_spot":["^You reach her usual spot and look around. The storm and rain make it difficult to see anything, but your senses sharpen, instinct guides you.","\n",{"->":"find_her"},{"#f":1}],"dangerous_passage":["^The rocks here are sharp, the currents brutal. Many avoid this place—but not her. You brace yourself and dive deeper, eyes scanning the shadows.","\n",{"->":"find_her"},{"#f":1}],"find_her":[["^Suddenly, there is her boat, rocking in the waves. You see her inside. She's safe.","\n","^She can't believe her eyes when she sees you.","\n","^\"I don't know how to explain\", you say, but she doesn't seem to hear your voice. She says something back, but this time you can't figure out what's she's saying. It's like her voice is muffled, you can't understand a word.","\n","^That doesn't matter right now. She's safe, and that's important. You push her boat back home, to safety.","\n","ev","str","^Back home","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"storm_1_ending"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"storm_1_ending":[["^By the time you reach your shack, the storm has passed. The rain has stopped. Everything is quiet.","\n","^She climbs up and looks down at you from the porch, unsure, hesitant.","\n","ev","str","^Try to pull up","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Stay in the water","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"try_pull_up"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"dont_try_to_pull_up"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"dont_try_to_pull_up":["^You don't even try to pull yourself up the ladder. Somehow, deep down, you understand you can't just get out of the water. The Sea is your home now.","\n",{"->":"storm_1_ending_final"},{"#f":1}],"try_pull_up":["^You reach for the ladder, almost out of habit—but your arms stop halfway.","\n","^Somehow, deep down, you understand you can't just get out of the water. The Sea is your home now.","\n",{"->":"storm_1_ending_final"},{"#f":1}],"storm_1_ending_final":["^\"It's fine. Go on. I'll stay here. We'll figure this out\", you say.","\n","^She shakes her head. Still can't hear you.","\n","^You have no words, not anymore.","\n","^You look at her.","\n","^Slowly, she makes a complicated hand gesture. Deliberate. And you understand what she's trying to say. You mirror it back.","\n","^You'll have a sign language of your own.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"storm_tourists_ending":[["^Next couple of days are spent repairing the shack, oiling the rusty parts, fixing the generator. Everyday somebody checks on you and the Diver. They offer help, bring soup or just come for a cup of coffee and company.","\n","^You're overwhelmed with gratidude. They helped you find the Diver, and for that, you'll always owe them more than you can express.","\n","ev","str","^Something's changed","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"something_changed"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"something_changed":[["^But then, after a few quiet days, something shifts.","\n","^It's subtle at first -- a few more people. A few more boats. You sell so much, you barely spend an hour at your stand before it's empty.","\n","^Adele's place is full. People start camping in tents. It's crowded. Noisy.","\n","ev","str","^Take a look outside","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"storm_2_ending"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"storm_2_ending":[["^Every morning, when you peak outside your window, the crowd is getting bigger. They want the Diver. They want her pearls.","\n","^They knock on your door, ask questions. It's exhausting.","\n","^She stopped going outside. She stays hidden, sad, barely speaking.","\n","^People in the village don't openly blame you, but they are tired, too. They stop visiting. They stop staying hello.","\n","^You get it. It's all your fault. The pearl you've sold started this plague.","\n","ev","str","^Leave the island","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"storm_2_ending_leave_the_island"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"storm_2_ending_leave_the_island":["^Your chest feels heavy. The shack is finally repaired. Safe, strong, beautiful. But you both know you can't stay. Not like this.","\n","^You pack your bags. Under the cover of the night, you say your quiet goodbyes. You take one last look at the Sea. \"I'm sorry. I'll see you soon again\", you mutter.","\n","^The Diver holds your hand.","\n","^Together, you leave.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"tide_alone_ending":[["^It's already pitch dark when you get back to the shack.","\n","^You switch on the lights, hearing the generator caugth and whizz outside, before it finally starts.","\n","^You sit on the porch, looking at what used to be the Sea. Did you make the right choice? What if that didn't work, and you're just sitting here, when the Diver is out there, needing you?","\n","^Minutes pass slowly. But then, you see a faint flickering light in the distance.","\n","^It has to be her.","\n","ev","str","^Wait","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Run towards the light","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"tide_alone_wait"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"tide_alone_run"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"tide_alone_wait":[["^You want to run to her but your body is too tired, too numb, so you just anxiously sit there and watch the light getting closer.","\n","^Seconds feel like hours, but she's finally next to you. She looks exhausted too, sits down next to you and grabs your hand, looking straight ahead. For a while, you just sit there in silence.","\n","ev","str","^Go to sleep","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Now that she's safe, you need some rest. You'll figure this out in the morning.","\n",{"->":"tide_alone_ending_2"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"tide_alone_run":[["^With the last of your strength, you get up, down the ladder, on the soft sand. You slowly run towards to light, panting heavily. You're not even sure if that's her, but you're too tired to care.","\n","^When she finally sees you, she throws the lantern on the dry seabed. Grabs you in her arms, and you finally feel you can breathe again. Slowly you go back to your shack.","\n","ev","str","^Go to sleep","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Now that she's safe, you need some rest. You'll figure this out in the morning.","\n",{"->":"tide_alone_ending_2"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"tide_alone_ending_2":[["^You wake up the next day feeling tired. At first you don't really remember what happened, but after a while it comes back. The terrible stench. The dead animals. The apocalypse.","\n","^The Diver is awake, on the porch.","\n","ev","str","^Go to the Diver","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"meet_her_on_porch"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"meet_her_on_porch":["^Just a day ago you've had a breakfast right here. Now the atmosphere feels eerily similar, but slightly off, just a little bit. At first you can't pinpoint what has changed exactly.","\n","^She looks straight ahead.","\n","^\"It's all dead, I think\", she says, quietly. \"The fish, the birds. Crabs and snails. Everything\"","\n","^You feel tears welling up. You grab her hand and she squeezes it tightly. You nod.","\n","^The Sea that you knew is gone. It's not giving back what it took.","\n","^By the evening, bags are packed. Just the essentials.","\n","^You touch the cracked wooden doorframe one more time, then never look back.","\n","^The Sea never forgets.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"tide_together_ending":[["^You all get back, rushing, tide advances quickly, the Sea coming closer than before.","\n","^The crowd lingers on the beach, nobody says a thing.","\n","^\"What's going on here?\", you feel your heart jump hearing her voice. The Diver. She's back, safe and sound. You run to her, stumbling in the sand.","\n","^You hear the crowd murmuring, discussing something, but right now you just want to go back home and have dinner with the Diver.","\n","ev","str","^Tell her everything","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"tell_diver_about_mermaids"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"tell_diver_about_mermaids":[["^You two spend the whole night discussing what you've just witnessed. First she's hesitant, she doesn't believe in the mermaid story, but she decides to trust you. The sun is already up when you finally go to bed.","\n","^Next morning, somebody knocks on your door.","\n","^\"Tourists can't come here anymore\"","\n","^You nod and invite the people in. You discuss your options but nobody argues -- they are dangerous, for you, for the Sea, for the mermaids. They have to stay away from now on.","\n","ev","str","^We need to keep our village safe","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"we_need_to_keep_village_safe"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"we_need_to_keep_village_safe":["^Soon the boat stops cruising. Roads are barricaded. \"UNSAFE WATER\", \"KEEP OUT\", \"BIOHAZARD\" say wooden signs all around the island.","\n","^Someone starts having meetings at midnight, moonlight shining with a silver glow. Offerings for the Sea and old rites combined into more and more elaborate ceremonies. Salt poured into circles. Fishscales in pockets, for good luck. Ancient songs resurrected.","\n","^The tourists try to come at first, but you all feel the Sea is also protecting you. The tides are too strong, the waves too high. Boats disappear in the thick fog. Ferries are turned back by strong current.","\n","^Your island becomes unreachable. It vanishes from the maps. Nobody tries to come anymore.","\n","^The Sea has claimed you back.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"silence_sceptic_leave_ending":[["^Days go by and you never speak about it again.","\n","^There's a growing distance between you two.","\n","ev","str","^You're worried","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You're angry","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"worried"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"angry"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"worried":["^You are worried about her. She's spending more and more time on the sea. Coming back late, spending the night in the dark waters. She doesn't listen when you beg her to stay.","\n",{"->":"silence_sceptic_leave_ending_2"},{"#f":1}],"angry":["^You're angry with her. You know it's not her fault and you hate yourself for this feeling, but you just want it to be over. You want to go back or move on.","\n",{"->":"silence_sceptic_leave_ending_2"},{"#f":1}],"silence_sceptic_leave_ending_2":[["ev","str","^Check her notes","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You can't help checking her notes and snooping around her stuff every night. You feel this is the only way to get to know how she really feels, but still, you feel guilty about not respecting her privacy.","\n","^Her notes and sketches scare you and you don't know what to do. You feel trapped in this decaying shack, barely standing, facing vast sea that is slowly taking her away from you.","\n",["ev","str","^Ask her to leave","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"ask_her_to_leave"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"ask_her_to_leave":["^\"We can't go on like this. We need to leave. Please...\", you plead.","\n","^She looks at you with an empty stare. Slowly shakes her head.","\n","^She takes your hand.","\n","^\"You go. It's too late for me\", she says calmly.","\n","^You feel tears going down your face. She kisses you on the forehead, but her gaze is distant. Her mind is at the sea.","\n","^You know you've lost her forever.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"silence_sceptic_rescue_ending":[["^Days go by, but everything is changed.","\n","^The first week, she barely gets out of the bed. She's exhausted from all the stress and she mostly sleeps. Bruises and scratches fade quickly, her body is healing. But her mind is not.","\n","^You try to spend as much time watching over her as possible, reading her stories quietly by her bed, singing old lullabies, brushing her hair. But without her diving trips the money is running short.","\n","^You don't eat on the porch anymore. Whenever the waves shake the shack too heavily, she flinches. Sometimes she wakes up in the middle of the night, crying.","\n","^Without a word, you understand. She's not going back there, which means that you can't stay here, not surrounded by the water, by the Sea.","\n","^You bring her closer, embrace her tightly. No need to be sorry. You understand.","\n","ev","str","^Leave the island","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"leave_the_island"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"leave_the_island":[["^Once the decision is made, she looks much better. She gets up, walks around, eats. She helps you pack.","\n","^\"Do you think we'll need that?\", she asks. An old map with your village marked on it with a red circle.","\n","^You've never been out of the island, on the mainland. You're not sure if you'd be able to get back without the map.","\n","ev","str","^Take it","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Don't","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"take_the_map"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"dont_take_map"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"take_the_map":["^\"Just as a reminder of where we came from\", you say. You slip the old laminated map into your bag.","\n","^She nods, eyes fixed on the wooden floor.","\n","^\"Okay\". Her voice is soft, but not broken.","\n",{"->":"leave_the_island_final"},{"#f":1}],"dont_take_map":["^You shake your head gently. \"No need,\" you say. “We won’t be coming back”","\n","^She nods, eyes fixed on the wooden floor. She sights, relieved.","\n",{"->":"leave_the_island_final"},{"#f":1}],"leave_the_island_final":["^Soon you're ready to go. The villagers understand, no questions asked. Someone offers to take care of the shack once you're gone, just in case you return. You hand them the keys, but tell them to do what they wish with the building and boats. You won't be back.","\n","^Your heart feels heavy but you try not to think too much about your departure. The sea, the island, the village -- they all mean so much. But not nearly as much as her.","\n","^You leave at dawn. She takes your hand, you squeeze it tight.","\n","^You don't look back.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue_ending":[["^You don't remember how you got back, your memory is all blurry and foggy. You're sitting on the porch when the Diver returns. You barely look at her, your eyes fixed on the blue horizon.","\n","^\"What's wrong?\", she asks, immediately feeling that something has changed. You slowly turn your head to look at her.","\n","ev","str","^Tell her everything","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You tell her everything -- your decision, the boat, the waves, finally... the mermaids. She listens silently, but the look on her face is getting darker with every word you say.","\n","^You feel a cold feeling creeping up your spine. She doesn't believe you.","\n",["ev","str","^Confront her","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Persuade her","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue_argue"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue_explain"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue_argue":[["^\"You know, all this wouldn't have happened if you came back on time\", you say coldly.","\n","^Her eyes soften and she nods.","\n","^\"I'm sorry\", she says.","\n","ev","str","^Forgive her","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^Of course you forgive her. She's just worried.","\n",{"->":"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue_ending_real"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue_explain":[["^\"You've got to believe me\", you plead. \"I'm telling the truth\"","\n","^She grabs your hand and squeezes it tightly. She looks you in the eye. You tell her again -- the scales, the waves, the mermaids.","\n","ev","str","^You know she doesn't believe you","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^She just watches you, silently. You know that look.","\n",{"->":"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue_ending_real"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_believer_mermaids_rescue_ending_real":[["^Days go by. You talk less and less, spending more time on the porch everyday. You don't set up your fishnets in the morning. You just cant -- you're worried you'll hurt something, or someone.","\n","^One day she quietly packs her backs, and surprisingly, you no longer care. Deep down, you still love her, but your obsession is consuming you whole.","\n","ev","str","^Let her leave","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^She leaves at dawn. You don't get up. The door shuts behind her with a drawn-out creek.","\n","^You stay. Everyday you sit, look at the sea, listen.","\n","^You keep the lanterns lit.","\n","^And when the wind picks up, you swear you hear them singing.","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"silence_sea_offering_ending":[["^You see a human shape and the blood rushes to your head. Without thinking, you jump right into cold waters, waves swallowing you whole instantly.","\n","^You feel a strange tingling all over your body. Strong current grabs you and pulls you deep down. Instinctively, you scream with fear, bubbles of air leaving your lungs. But you're not suffocating. You're not drowning. You muscles relax, blood pumping through your veins.","\n","ev","str","^Look down","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^You look down to see a strong tail covered in dark blue scales, translucent fins flowing with the current.","\n","^You move the tail, gently. It feels natural. Yours.","\n","^There's thousands of questions in your head, but a single thought sharpens. The Diver. She still needs you.","\n",["ev","str","^Swim to her","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"swim_to_diver"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"swim_to_diver":[["^Unsure at first, you start swimming. It feels so easy, so natural. You quickly gain speed, piercing through the dark waters.","\n","^Within seconds you reach her. You look into her eyes -- it's her. But something has changed, too.","\n","^Silver hair. Soft gills on her neck. A long, strong tail in the water.","\n","^She smiles at you. Takes your hand and you swim deep down.","\n","ev","str","^You are a mermaid now","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n",{"->":"being_a_mermaid"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"being_a_mermaid":[["^Time passes, no longer measured in days but in tides. You don't really sleep anymore, spending your time down the Sea. At first you feel like your older self, a visitor in a strange new world. But slowly the memories of your former life begin to fade. You become more like water, free, fluid, one with the nature.","\n","^She's always there with you and you feel closer as ever. You just enjoy your company, no quarrels, no bills, no problems. You just exists peacefully.","\n","^However, sometimes you still feel this calling, pulling you back to your old life. She doesn't understand and doesn't approve. She let go completely and she wants you let go too.","\n","ev","str","^Swim to the shack","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Let it go","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"swim_to_shack"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"let_it_go"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"swim_to_shack":["^Just this once, you decide to swim back. Your last goodbye. You have no idea how much human time has passed.","\n","^You swim close to the shack, pull yourself up and wrap your arms around one of the wooden legs. The building sways with a familiar crack. The lights are on -- you hear laughs, smell soup.","\n","^But you feel nothing. This is not your world anymore.","\n",{"->":"mermaids_ending_final"},{"#f":1}],"let_it_go":["^You close your eyes and let this last memory slip away. She smiles at you and you smile back. You are happy to be there with her. You wouldn't make any other choice. But still, deep down, you feel yearning, a quiet voice in the back of your head.","\n",{"->":"mermaids_ending_final"},{"#f":1}],"mermaids_ending_final":[["ev","str","^You're...happy?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Under the Sea, you're quite happy. It is calm and she's with you.","\n","^There’s nothing more you need — almost.","\n","^Still, something small remains, silent and sharp.","\n","^A splinter you’ll never quite reach.","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev",0,{"VAR=":"believer"},0,{"VAR=":"sceptic"},false,{"VAR=":"hasPearl"},false,{"VAR=":"talkedToEloise"},false,{"VAR=":"soldPearl"},false,{"VAR=":"opposeEloise"},false,{"VAR=":"isStorm"},false,{"VAR=":"isTide"},"str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"offeringType"},false,{"VAR=":"isGeneratorDown"},false,{"VAR=":"isFishnetsDown"},false,{"VAR=":"didJumpIntoSea"},3,{"VAR=":"spotsLeft"},false,{"VAR=":"isAlone"},false,{"VAR=":"bruisedLeg"},false,{"VAR=":"isCarSave"},"/ev","end",null],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}};